.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH HOPASH-RULE 1 2026-08-01 "Hopash RS 0.1.0" "Hopash RS User Commands"
.SH NAME
hopash\-rule \- List and atomically mutate the Local Rule Set
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhopash rule\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List and atomically mutate the Local Rule Set
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
hopash\-rule\-list(1)
List Local Rule Set entries in effective order
.TP
hopash\-rule\-add(1)
Insert one complete Rule String at an explicit position
.TP
hopash\-rule\-replace(1)
Replace one exact, complete Rule String
.TP
hopash\-rule\-remove(1)
Remove one exact, complete Rule String
